WEBVTT

1
00:00:09.667 --> 00:00:14.826
I am a baker.

2
00:00:14.827 --> 00:00:19.131
I bake bread, cake, and cookies.

3
00:00:19.132 --> 00:00:23.558
Today I am baking chocolate chip cookies.

4
00:00:23.559 --> 00:00:25.742
You can help me!

5
00:00:25.743 --> 00:00:31.010
First we need a large bowl.

6
00:00:31.011 --> 00:00:36.896
We put butter in the bowl.

7
00:00:36.897 --> 00:00:48.035
We add sugar, eggs, and vanilla.

8
00:00:48.036 --> 00:00:53.961
Let's stir, stir, stir!

9
00:00:53.962 --> 00:01:03.543
Now we pour in flour.

10
00:01:03.544 --> 00:01:16.758
Next come salt and baking soda.

11
00:01:16.759 --> 00:01:22.179
Then we stir again.

12
00:01:22.180 --> 00:01:25.959
We add the chocolate chips.

13
00:01:25.960 --> 00:01:29.452
We stir a few more times, and . . .

14
00:01:29.453 --> 00:01:34.660
Look! We made cookie dough!

15
00:01:34.661 --> 00:01:37.318
We scoop up dough.

16
00:01:37.319 --> 00:01:47.279
We drop spoonfuls of dough on a tray.

17
00:01:47.280 --> 00:01:50.997
The cookies bake in the oven.

18
00:01:50.998 --> 00:01:53.443
Are they ready yet?

19
00:01:53.444 --> 00:01:56.793
No, not yet!

20
00:01:56.794 --> 00:02:06.355
Brring! In ten minutes our cookies are ready.

21
00:02:06.356 --> 00:02:13.212
Mmm . . . I think chocolate chip cookies are yummy!

22
00:02:13.213 --> 00:02:18.782
Do you like them too?
